{
  "note": "#256's 완료 조건 «과거 세 사례는 당시 시점 자료만으로 분류·논거 복원이 되는지 확인한다», for this package's case — NAVER (035420), decided 2026-06-24.\n\nEvery field below is transcribed from the investor's own private record at a fixed commit and is dated on or before the decision date. `series` is the daily OHLCV the record itself holds — public exchange data, and the only thing this package can compute a technical state from. Nothing else from that record is copied here: no balances, no order ids, no account values.\n\n⛔ What this fixture does **not** claim. It is not a re-audit of the investor's reported ~10% result, which #256 says was never re-audited and is not a validated edge. It is not a backtest and not a reproduction of the upstream harness. No threshold in `lib/core.mjs` was touched for it, and the outcome is whatever `classifyCase` returned on the first run — which is `data-missing`.\n\n⚠️ **The as-of bar is 2026-06-23, not 2026-06-24.** The plan is timestamped 13:10 KST on 2026-06-24, before that session closed, and this package reviews on completed daily bars — a run holding a partial newest bar is refused by `newest_bar_may_be_unclosed`. So the replay's newest row is the last session that had actually closed when the decision was made.",
